    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### NetBird Mesh Control Plane\nEnrollment-path health: the signal-server liveness + Go runtime, the public enrollment endpoint reachability (blackbox HTTPS to `netbird.\u2026`), and relay-tier reachability (ICMP). **signal-server app-metric names are not yet referenced in-repo** \u2014 this board uses `up` + `go_*`/`process_*` (which Go exporters always emit) and the blackbox signals, so it lights up even before app metrics are confirmed."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "signal-server up",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
